    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55305" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-αστράπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hurl down lightning, flash lightning</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ Οἰταῖον νάπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					437
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστράπτει</span>
			<i>it lightens</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>strike with lightning, dazzle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ὄψεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				27.337d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ τῷ κάλλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					1.21
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλοις κ. τὸ πεδίον</span>
			<i>make</i> it <i>gleam</i> with arms, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				9.14
			</span></i>.</div>
